flowchart LR
    subgraph Client["Client"]
        A[Bearer ak-...]
    end

    A --> B[Idempotency check]
    B --> C[Virtual-key auth]
    C --> D[Rate limit]
    D --> E[DLP scan]
    E --> F[Budget pre-check]
    F --> G[Model resolution]
    G --> H{Primary provider}

    H -->|success| I[Collect response]
    H -->|refusal/error| J[Retry policy]
    J --> K{Fallback available?}
    K -->|yes| L[Next provider]
    K -->|no| M[Return error]
    L --> H

    I --> N[(llm_usage_events)]

    style A fill:#151517,stroke:#ec4899,stroke-width:2px
    style N fill:#151517,stroke:#ec4899,stroke-width:2px
    style H fill:#1c1c1f,stroke:#ec4899
    style L fill:#1c1c1f,stroke:#ec4899
